{"id":"te_le_gramme","lemma":"télégramme","pos":"noun","rank":3779,"glosses":["telegram"],"ipa":"/te.le.ɡʁam/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/Fr-t%C3%A9l%C3%A9gramme.ogg/Fr-t%C3%A9l%C3%A9gramme.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"télégrammes"},"examples":[{"text":"Quand as-tu reçu le télégramme ?","en":"When did you receive the telegram?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai reçu un télégramme d'elle.","en":"I received a telegram from her.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"she / it"}]},{"text":"Elle m'a envoyé un télégramme urgent.","en":"She sent me an urgent telegram.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to send","l":"envoyer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"urgent"}]},{"text":"J'ai reçu un télégramme disant que mon oncle était arrivé.","en":"I received a telegram saying that my uncle had arrived.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"uncle"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"}]},{"text":"Il reçut un télégramme disant que sa mère était décédée.","en":"He received a telegram saying that his mother had died.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to receive","l":"recevoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"dire"},{"g":"that / what"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"fuck!"]]}]}